{"title":"The Other Side","artist":"The Great Showman","sourceId":"reference:uJoDuTEGN17D5FQ7vJo6","sourceHash":"ae9c1f0e9f4ae9e4a4f1900da7590bb5f2bf12b792f9c1b808a258d8986a9c40","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":36856922,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":8.25,"end":9.68,"text":"Right here, right now","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":9.68,"end":11.22,"text":"I put the offer out","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":11.22,"end":12.42,"text":"I don't wanna chase you down","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":12.42,"end":14.43,"text":"I know you see it","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":14.43,"end":15.98,"text":"You run with me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":15.98,"end":17.43,"text":"And I can cut you free","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":17.43,"end":22.2,"text":"Out of the drudgery and walls you keep in","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":22.2,"end":25.22,"text":"So trade that typical for something colorful","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":25.22,"end":28.43,"text":"And if it's crazy, live a little crazy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":28.43,"end":31.48,"text":"You can play it sensible, a king of conventional","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":31.48,"end":36.07,"text":"Or you can risk it all and see","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":36.07,"end":38.75,"text":"Don't you wanna get away","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":38.75,"end":41.99,"text":"From the same old part you gotta play?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":41.99,"end":43.43,"text":"'Cause I got what you need","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":43.43,"end":46.27,"text":"So come with me and take the ride","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":46.27,"end":48.76,"text":"It'll take you to the other side","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":48.76,"end":50.25,"text":"'Cause you can do like you do","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":50.25,"end":51.83,"text":"Or you can do like me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":51.83,"end":54.65,"text":"Stay in the cage, or you'll finally take the key","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":54.65,"end":58.74,"text":"Oh, damn, suddenly you're free to fly","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":58.74,"end":61.2,"text":"It'll take you to the other side","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":61.2,"end":64.06,"text":"Okay, my friend, you wanna cut me in","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":64.06,"end":65.57,"text":"Well, I hate to tell you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":65.57,"end":67.31,"text":"But it just won't happen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":67.31,"end":68.88,"text":"So thanks, but no","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":68.88,"end":70.55,"text":"I think I'm good to go","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":70.55,"end":71.51,"text":"'Cause I quite enjoy the life","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":71.51,"end":73.53,"text":"You say I'm trapped in","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":73.53,"end":76.51,"text":"Now I admire you, and that whole show you do","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":76.51,"end":79.77,"text":"You're onto something, really it's something","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":79.77,"end":82.89,"text":"But I live among the swells, we don't pick up peanut shells","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":82.89,"end":85.99,"text":"I'll have to leave that up to you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":85.99,"end":88.69,"text":"Don't you know that I'm okay","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":88.69,"end":91.62,"text":"With this uptown part I get to play?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":91.62,"end":93.33,"text":"'Cause I got what I need","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":93.33,"end":96.28,"text":"And I don't want to take the ride","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":96.28,"end":98.45,"text":"I don't need to see the other side","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":98.45,"end":100.03999999999999,"text":"So go and do like you do","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":100.03999999999999,"end":101.6,"text":"I'm good to do like me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":101.6,"end":104.59,"text":"Ain't in a cage, so I don't need to take the key","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":104.59,"end":108.62,"text":"Oh, damn, can't you see I'm doing fine?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":108.62,"end":110.78,"text":"I don't need to see the other side","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":110.78,"end":113.65,"text":"Is this really how you like to spend your days","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":113.65,"end":116.62,"text":"Whiskey and misery, and parties and plays?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":116.62,"end":119.61,"text":"If I were mixed up with you, I'd be the talk of the town","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":119.61,"end":122.82,"text":"Disgraced and disowned, another one of the clowns","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":122.82,"end":126.49,"text":"But you would finally live a little, finally laugh a little","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":126.49,"end":129.07,"text":"Just let me give you the freedom to dream","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":129.07,"end":132.65,"text":"And it'll wake you up and cure your aching","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":132.65,"end":135.85,"text":"Take your walls and start 'em breaking","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":135.85,"end":140.81,"text":"Now that's a deal, that seems worth taking","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":140.81,"end":144.81,"text":"But I guess I'll leave that up to you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":148.85,"end":151.9,"text":"Well, it's intriguing, but to go would cost me greatly","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":151.9,"end":155.28,"text":"So what percentage of the show would I be taking?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":155.28,"end":158.16,"text":"Fair enough, you'd want a piece of all the action","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":158.16,"end":161.48,"text":"I'd give you seven, we could shake and make it happen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":161.48,"end":164.44,"text":"I wasn't born this morning, 18 would be just fine","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":164.44,"end":167.57999999999998,"text":"Why not just go ahead and ask for nickels on the dime?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":167.57999999999998,"end":169.02,"text":"15 (I'd do eight)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":169.02,"end":170.35,"text":"12 (maybe nine)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":170.35,"end":173.66,"text":"Ten","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":173.66,"end":176.41,"text":"Don't you wanna get away","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":176.41,"end":179.45,"text":"To a whole new part you're gonna play?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":179.45,"end":181.05,"text":"'Cause I got what you need","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":181.05,"end":184.53,"text":"So come with me and take the ride","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":184.53,"end":186.38,"text":"To the other side","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":186.38,"end":187.84,"text":"So if you do like I do","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":187.84,"end":189.49,"text":"So if you do like me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":189.49,"end":192.22,"text":"Forget the cage, 'cause we know how to make the key","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":192.22,"end":196.54,"text":"Oh, damn, suddenly we're free to fly","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":196.54,"end":198.78,"text":"We're going to the other side","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":198.78,"end":201.85,"text":"So if you do like I do (to the other side)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":201.85,"end":204.82999999999998,"text":"So if you do like me (we're going to the other side)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":204.82999999999998,"end":208.82999999999998,"text":"'Cause if we do like (we're going to the other side)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":208.82999999999998,"end":210.5,"text":"We're going to the other side","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}